## Why This Is Asked

This question probes architectural decisions for multi-tenant Azure AI deployments with strict data residency, governance, and explainability requirements. It tests ability to plan region-aware routing, tenant-scoped knowledge bases, identity boundaries, and end-to-end auditing.

## Key Concepts

- Data residency and customer-managed keys (CMK) for storage
- Region-local Cognitive Search indexes per tenant
- Region-aware model routing for Azure OpenAI
- Per-tenant RBAC using Azure AD
- Explainability logging to Data Lake with traceability
- End-to-end testing including latency, privacy, and auditability

## Code Example

