## Why This Is Asked

Assess ability to design a secure, scalable retrieval-augmented reviewer with per-tenant isolation, governance, and observability for code and IaC changes.

## Key Concepts

- Multi-tenant isolation and per-tenant KB
- Retrieval-Augmented Generation with Cognitive Search
- PII/secret redaction via Text Analytics and Key Vault
- Policy engine to block leakage
- Canary rollout behind API Management
- Auditing and data lineage in Data Lake

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudocode: route a prompt with redaction and policy check
async function handleRequest(req){
  const payload = redactPII(req.payload);
  if(!policyAllows(payload)) throw new Error('Blocked');
  const ans = await openai.request({prompt: payload, ...req.options});
  logAudit(req, ans);
  return ans;
}
```

